        "Telugu-speaking states face growing deaf and hard of hearing populations driven by urban noise exposure and limited preventative healthcare reach in rural Andhra Pradesh and Telangana. The infrastructure gap between scale and daily-life support is among the widest in South Asia. Captio AI captions Telugu speech in real time — including fast colloquial registers, Hyderabadi Telugu, and code-switching with Hindi and English — so the street stall, the rickshaw, and the family gathering are no longer settings you have to navigate alone.",
