        "The GBD 2019 study on hearing loss found that it accounted for approximately 6% of global disability-adjusted life years — among the most prevalent causes of disability worldwide. Estonia has the infrastructure to address this but has not yet embedded real-time captioning as a baseline provision in university lecture halls. For a deaf student at Tartu University navigating lectures in Estonian with its three-way quantity system — entirely invisible from lip position — Captio AI provides real-time captions that resolve the acoustic distinctions no lip-reader can detect.",
